<p  class="heading">Our Story</p>
<p class="content">Baking Sisters began as a heartfelt dream shared by two sisters, <b><i>Nooria</i></b> and <b><i>Shanzy</i></b>, five years ago in the heart of Lahore. With Nooria’s passion for baking and Shanzy’s expertise in software engineering, they blended creativity and technology to bring a unique flair to the world of desserts. What started as a small kitchen experiment has grown into a delightful destination for custom cakes, pastries, and sweet experiences. Every creation at Baking Sisters is a work of love—where flavor meets art, and every bite tells a story. Together, they’ve turned their dream into a brand that celebrates joy, family, and the magic of homemade baking.</p>
